MKT4423.description:
This module aims to raise the understanding of the significance of Design Thinking, Business Modeling & Lean LaunchPad; and its innovative applications to businesses.
It would provide:
• insights and practices of Design Thinking at the personal & organizational level;
• appreciation of business modeling and innovations & lean methodology;
• an experience of the processes and methodologies needed to take a creative idea all the way to market. It does these through a series of lectures, case studies, and intensive design thinking workshops; couple with field visits.

